                "text": "I could hardly pronounce \u201cneuroendocrine\u201d tumor, a rare form of cancer, when I got to MD Anderson in mid-July 2022.\n\nBut I knew that any tumor spreading across your body isn\u2019t good.\n\nI hadn\u2019t told many people about my diagnosis even as so many things raced through my mind. 8/ https://t.co/jQLJD7Fo2J",
